# ERF-LNG Phase 3 regression test — 2D→3D Scalar Injection Coupling
#
# Tests: LNG → ATM coupling via 2D evaporation flux injected into 3D passive scalar.
#        Validates one-step explicit lag (flux from step n injected at step n+1).
#        Sounding and ATM configuration copied from DustCriticalMaterials.
#
# Pass criteria (checked by README and CTest):
#   (1) Compiles and runs 5 steps, exit code 0.
#   (2) [LNG COUPLING] Phase 3: F_evap_max appears 5 times in stdout (one per step).
#   (3) [LNG DEBUG] Phase 3: apply_to_cc_source appears 5 times in stdout.
#   (4) RhoLNG_tend_sum > 0 every step (vapor mass is being injected).
#   (5) With atm_feedback=0.0: no [LNG COUPLING] prints appear (injection is gated).
#   (6) lng_diag.csv has 1 header + 5 data rows.
#   (7) No NaN in any LNG MultiFab ([LNG DEBUG] NaN check PASSED 5 times).

